From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flavius <Flavius256@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:51:29 +0000
Subject: c for the port

Write the C so the port's translation reads it.

- src/overlays/l07_umbris/taxi_platform.c: the Bombomatic's hit handler names its local
  hit_message, not s16. A local named after a type shadows it, and hostgen writes casts by the
  type's name.
- src/core/libc/close_dtoa.c: the line marker gives its source's path from OpenRAC's top, not
  one machine's.
- src/game/system/loaders.c: the class-resource arrays after class_resource_ids (D_001CBEA0,
  D_001CBF60, D_001CC0E0) are reached from that base, as one block: the level loader pairs
  only the first base, so the port relocates the others with it.
- include/callees.h: func_001F9E58 returns int, as its callers read it.
- config/port_symbols.txt: the pause menu mobys' update under its current name.

Co-authored-by: ReaperOfVeriod <oeps46@gmail.com>
